stagerig-os (0.3.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * The wallpaper comes in six screen shapes (16:9, 16:10, 3:2, 4:3, 21:9
    and 32:9) and the one nearest the main screen is chosen at login and
    whenever a screen is connected, so the wordmark sits in the corner on
